# ⛔ ONE FILE OUT OF 729 WAS STORED WITH CRLF, AND IT COST A GATE.
#
# src/demo/assets/app.js was committed with CRLF line endings while every other tracked
# text file uses LF. `git diff --check` inspects ADDED lines only, so the CR at end of line
# read as trailing whitespace on every line of every edit to that one file — a gate that
# fires on every change is a gate people learn to step over. (HR-63.)
#
# Normalising the file fixes the instance; this file stops it recurring in any other.
* text=auto eol=lf
